---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — ZTP." description="About Zach and ZachsTechPage.">
  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 700px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">&gt;ztp. whoami</span>
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>Hey, I'm Zach.</p>

      <p>ZachsTechPage (ZTP) is a place for me to document, learn, build and track my process and progress along the way, all in the name of learning.</p>

      <p>I work in IT, and right now I'm building up my skills in cloud infrastructure, Azure and cybersecurity. Expect a mix of home lab stuff, real learning and the occasional "I broke this and figured out why" post.</p>

      <p>This isn't expert advice from someone who's got it all figured out. It's just the process, out loud. If you're on a similar path, hope it helps. If not, welcome anyway.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
